#!RuleTest
#test FDA-SE2261 expect=violation domain=TP
#note "Second in-scope domain: TP carries RPATHCD as its topic variable; the 21-character value on row 1 fires."
#library standard=sendig-dart version=1-1
#expectViolationCount 1
#expectViolationAt row=1 RPATHCD=PATH-COHORT-F0-MALE12
dataset TP label="Trial Repro Paths"
col STUDYID type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN  type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col RPATHCD type=Char label="Planned Repro Path Code"
col RPATH   type=Char label="Planned Repro Path"
---
S1 | TP | PATH-COHORT-F0-MALE12 | F0 male path
S1 | TP | PATH-COHORT-F0-MALE1 | F0 male path
